{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  Turn2Opinion — email system v1 ("the conversation")
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 11. Referral invitation
  File       : invite.liquid
  Class      : Engagement (marketing — unsubscribe required)
  Trigger    : An existing member invited this address
  Tone       : coral
  Replaces   : invite.liquid

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. {{ user.fullName }} invited you to Turn2Opinion
    2. {{ user.fullName }} thinks your opinion is worth rewarding
    3. An invitation to get rewarded for your opinions

  PREHEADER
    Free to join, no investment. Share your opinions in paid surveys and get rewarded your way.

  PRIMARY CTA
    Accept the invitation  ->  ref.link

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/invite.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/11-invite.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
